# Payments rules

Full spec: `@docs/architecture.md` §7.2 (fee split).

Hard rules:

- All fee splits computed in `lib/payments/split.ts`. Never inline.
- Every split has a table-driven test. New split? Add a test row first.
- Stripe webhooks dedupe on `stripeEventId` in a `StripeWebhookEvent` table.
- Instructor onboarding uses Stripe Connect **Express**, not Standard or Custom.
- Never surface raw Stripe errors to users. Map to friendly codes.
- Payouts run via cron, not on-demand. See `docs/architecture.md` §7.4.
